      {
        "title": "Section 6",
        "type": "narrative",
        "paragraphs": [
          "| Code | Procedure Name | Concept Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| INA-PRC-049 | Preventive Maintenance Execution (Plant) | PM execution, confirmations, and compliance reporting |\n| INA-PRC-051 | Shutdown & Turnaround Maintenance Management | Major shutdown planning, execution control, and closeout |\n| INA-PRC-052 | Condition-Based Maintenance Monitoring & Alerts | Condition monitoring thresholds and action triggers |\n| INA-PRC-053 | Predictive Maintenance Analytics (ML/AI) | Model-based prediction, anomaly detection, and intervention planning |\n| INA-PRC-074 | Process Optimization & Digital Twin Model Management | Maintain process models, calibrate vs reality, scenario testing |\n| INA-PRC-075 | Decision Support Cockpit (Production/Energy/Reliability) | Management cockpit for integrated KPIs and decision workflows |\n| INA-PRC-076 | OT Cybersecurity & Network Hardening (Asset/SCADA) | Asset inventory, segmentation, hardening, monitoring, incident handling |\n| INA-PRC-077 | Dual SCADA Architecture Governance & Lifecycle | Architecture standards, redundancy testing, change control |\n| INA-PRC-085 | Manufacturing Data Integration & MES–QMS/LIMS Orchestration | Orchestrate quality gates and ensure data lineage across systems |\n| INA-PRC-098 | Lubrication Route Planning & Execution (Plant-wide) | Route-based lubrication with readings, exceptions, and compliance dashboards |\n| INA-PRC-099 | Instrument/Analyzer Calibration Work Management | Calibration work orders, schedules, evidence capture, and expiry alerts for critical instruments |\n| INA-PRC-126 | Anode Location Audit, Cycle Count & Exception Handling | Verify anode locations/status vs physical; resolve exceptions/holds and ensure traceability |"
        ],
